## How this repo is built

This project follows the [Vibe-code-Architect](https://github.com/SumukhaK/Vibe-code-Architect)
workflow: a human owner, a reviewer model and worker agents, held to rules that are
enforced by CI rather than by hope.

- **Rules for agents:** [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md)
- **What we're building:** [`docs/PRD.md`](docs/PRD.md)
- **How, and why:** [`docs/TECHNICAL.md`](docs/TECHNICAL.md) and [`docs/adr/`](docs/adr/)
- **What's being worked on:** GitHub Issues
- **Map of the code:** [`docs/CODEMAP.md`](docs/CODEMAP.md) (generated)

## Development
{% if 'python' in stacks %}
### Python

```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate   # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
ruff check . && ruff format --check .
pyright
lint-imports
pytest
```
